      "type": "rational_expression_equivalence",
      "question": "If x > 3, which of the following is equivalent to 1 / (1/(x + 2) + 1/(x + 3))?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "(x² + 5x + 6)/(2x + 5)",
        "B": "(2x + 5)/(x² + 5x + 6)",
        "C": "(x² + 5x + 6)/(x + 5)",
        "D": "2x + 5"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Combine: 1/(x+2) + 1/(x+3) = (2x + 5)/((x+2)(x+3)) = (2x + 5)/(x² + 5x + 6). The reciprocal is (x² + 5x + 6)/(2x + 5)."
    },
